{"video_id": "BU5HwNyE4mk", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 54.29999923706055, "end_seconds": 57.439998626708984, "text": "It was a strange and counterintuitive phenomenon,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "BU5HwNyE4mk", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 57.439998626708984, "end_seconds": 61.20000076293945, "text": "one that the Russians kept secret for 10 years.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "BU5HwNyE4mk", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 61.20000076293945, "end_seconds": 64.27999877929688, "text": "Six years later, in 1991, a paper was published", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "BU5HwNyE4mk", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 64.27999877929688, "end_seconds": 67.08000183105469, "text": "in the Journal of Dynamics and Differential Equations", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
